      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 6.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.25,
      "end_seconds": 12.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 23.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "It's a growing red ring on my thigh. I thought I'd wait, um, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.38,
      "end_seconds": 31.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.78,
      "end_seconds": 35.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "For four weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.13,
      "end_seconds": 51.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "did you get facial weakness or stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.0,
      "end_seconds": 55.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.65,
      "end_seconds": 59.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Did you get palpitations or joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.15,
      "end_seconds": 65.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I haven't had palpitations or joint swelling, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.03,
      "end_seconds": 71.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.09,
      "end_seconds": 74.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.33,
      "end_seconds": 95.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.15,
      "end_seconds": 98.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I've had migraines, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.18,
      "end_seconds": 101.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.48,
      "end_seconds": 106.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.49,
      "end_seconds": 110.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.34,
      "end_seconds": 118.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.83,
      "end_seconds": 130.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.68,
      "end_seconds": 136.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Hmm, no, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.14,
      "end_seconds": 140.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.93,
      "end_seconds": 146.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.68,
      "end_seconds": 149.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.99,
      "end_seconds": 154.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.47,
      "end_seconds": 159.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.86,
      "end_seconds": 164.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.4,
      "end_seconds": 175.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.98,
      "end_seconds": 190.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.26,
      "end_seconds": 214.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "okay: temperature 37.0, BP is 111 over 71, SpO2 97 percent on room air, heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.05,
      "end_seconds": 220.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.14,
      "end_seconds": 236.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.69,
      "end_seconds": 240.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Right, look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.03,
      "end_seconds": 259.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "There is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.94,
      "end_seconds": 262.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.85,
      "end_seconds": 287.56,
      "duration_seconds": 19.71,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is early Lyme disease. So, to recap quickly. You've had a growing red ring on your thigh for four weeks, and no facial weakness or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.45,
      "end_seconds": 291.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Mm, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.19,
      "end_seconds": 309.9,
      "duration_seconds": 17.71,
      "text": "We'll begin with doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, twenty-one days. You take it by mouth. That's for early Lyme disease. Take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.66,
      "end_seconds": 312.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.21,
      "end_seconds": 321.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "I'll want another look in three weeks right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.2,
      "end_seconds": 326.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.42,
      "end_seconds": 329.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
